      <link>https://www.mantecabulletin.com/news/local-news/california-keys-help-usher-in-2026-with-2-shows-at-dead-puppy-comedy-club/</link>
      <description>The most unique New Year’s Eve Party this year in Manteca will arguably take place at the Deaf Comedy Club. The California Keys — dueling pianos — are the feature of two shows at 8 p.m. and 10:15 p.m. Wednesday at the downtown comedy club at 127 North Main Street.</description>
